# Code owners for ForgeLM.
#
# CODEOWNERS asks the owner of a changed path for a review when a pull request
# is opened. It does not block a merge on its own: branch protection for
# `development` does not require code-owner reviews, so an unresponsive owner
# cannot stall a contribution. See docs/standards/code-review.md for the review
# standard and GOVERNANCE.md for how ownership is granted.
#
# The project currently has one maintainer; each area gets its own owner once a
# co-maintainer takes responsibility for it (see MAINTAINERS.md).

